9:["$","section",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-[hsl(var(--content-fg))]","children":"Other Solitaire Types"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-[hsl(var(--content-fg-muted))]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"The world of solitaire extends far beyond Klondike. Here are some other popular types:"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["FreeCell: All 52 cards are dealt face-up into 8 columns. Four free cells provide temporary storage. Build foundations by suit. Over 99% of deals are solvable, making it the most skill-based solitaire."," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.freecell.to","className":"font-semibold text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"Play FreeCell online free"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Spider Solitaire: Uses two decks (104 cards) dealt into 10 columns. Build descending sequences by suit in the tableau. Complete sequences are automatically removed. Comes in 1-suit (easy), 2-suit (medium), and 4-suit (hard) variations."," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.spidersolitaire.to","className":"font-semibold text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"Play Spider Solitaire online free"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Pyramid Solitaire: 28 cards form a pyramid shape. Remove pairs of exposed cards that sum to 13. Kings (worth 13) are removed alone. A unique matching puzzle that is quite different from building-style solitaire."," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.pyramidsolitaire.io","className":"font-semibold text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"Play Pyramid Solitaire online free"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["TriPeaks: 28 cards in three overlapping peaks. Remove cards that are one rank higher or lower than the foundation card. Fast-paced and streak-based."," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.tripeaks.to","className":"font-semibold text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline","children":"Play TriPeaks Solitaire online free"}],"."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Golf Solitaire: 35 cards in 7 columns of 5. Remove cards one rank higher or lower than the foundation. Simple rules with a par-scoring system."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Canfield: Similar to Klondike but with a 13-card reserve pile and different dealing rules. Often confused with Klondike in some regions."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Each solitaire type offers a distinct strategic experience. If you enjoy Klondike, we recommend trying FreeCell next for a more strategic challenge, or Golf Solitaire for a faster, simpler experience."}]]}]]}]
